# The four evidence logs are written during a run and MUST NOT be committed.
# `.prototypes/` is a tracked directory and the repo root .gitignore has no *.log rule, so
# without this file a `git add -A` after a spike run would publish the session's shell
# transcript (spike-hook.log records every gated Bash command line verbatim).
spike-mcp.log
spike-hook.log
spike-cli.log
spike-async.log

# Screenshots taken while running README.md.
shot-*.png
